# The SQLite game database is intentionally tracked for the current Alpha workflow.
# Keep this repository private if it contains real account/character data; never
# commit server_config.json, credentials, tokens, or production secrets.
# The full raw art archive (reference/assets/) is committed so the whole team has
# it. It contains the game's PNG art, Aseprite/Illustrator/EPS sources, and the
# Tiled map sources. Only macOS junk and the three >100 MB vector source files
# (tracked via Git LFS) are handled specially.
reference/**/.DS_Store

